limpa-rs uses the statistical model implemented by SmythLab/limpa 1.4.2
(https://github.com/SmythLab/limpa), licensed GPL (>= 2).

The R-compatible BFGS routine is adapted from R src/appl/optim.c (vmmin),
Copyright (C) 1999-2025 The R Core Team, GPL version 2 or later.
https://github.com/wch/r-source/blob/trunk/src/appl/optim.c
R's implementation credits J. C. Nash and B. D. Ripley.

The Spectronaut driver is adapted from Deliverome-Project/deliverome-analysis
PR #141, commit 32c563c95410637e0431faf27eab1e7a9786464b.
The original filtering, global parameter estimation, annotation and limma
steps remain in R. The Rust solver is not a complete R-free LIMPA port.

